    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/3d31403efafccf3adb72312a8a451be2.avif?t=1754283788\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/47c05f556f88522c7acf0052517ed0c4.webp?t=1754283788\" /></div>Dive into a world where every jump, slide, and dash feels incredibly satisfying. Vista World offers an immersive platforming experience that keeps you on the edge of your seat with its captivating gameplay and stunning visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/6c9aba017536fc7f77549ceee3b08c65.poster.avif?t=1754283788\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/6c9aba017536fc7f77549ceee3b08c65.webm?t=1754283788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/6c9aba017536fc7f77549ceee3b08c65.mp4?t=1754283788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/bebb79ba4b7f7f7ea091ba93721e1caf.webp?t=1754283788\" /></div>Unleash your creativity with our intuitive level editor. Build intricate levels from scratch, place traps, enemies, and obstacles, and share your creations with the community. The only limit is your imagination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/14733493bbdee2b02f6ac291def2dc29.poster.avif?t=1754283788\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/14733493bbdee2b02f6ac291def2dc29.webm?t=1754283788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/14733493bbdee2b02f6ac291def2dc29.mp4?t=1754283788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/c3c62a0178cfd8afb618a88fcae05793.webp?t=1754283788\" /></div>Join a vibrant community of creators and players. Design your own levels, share them with friends, and explore an ever-growing library of user-generated content. The adventure never ends in Vista World.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/39b83086a413392d7916f769aaafccb2.avif?t=1754283788\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/65ef6e01133b752067248d7df70a29bd.webp?t=1754283788\" /></div>Experience the smoothest and most responsive controls in a platformer. Every movement is designed to be fluid and precise, giving you complete control over your character as you navigate through challenging environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/7dfbec5c4d91e0f334fe3ff9a2011174.poster.avif?t=1754283788\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/7dfbec5c4d91e0f334fe3ff9a2011174.webm?t=1754283788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/7dfbec5c4d91e0f334fe3ff9a2011174.mp4?t=1754283788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/3d23f1f5075392c62f28b9890c798348.webp?t=1754283788\" /></div>Face off against a variety of dynamic enemies and navigate through perilous traps. Each encounter is designed to test your skills and keep you engaged, ensuring that no two levels feel the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/ea796aaabbcaa4126d9841713f5051ae.avif?t=1754283788\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/c1951cbccc126b43a0f4748f31de1546.webp?t=1754283788\" /></div>Embark on an epic journey through a meticulously crafted story mode. Discover the secrets of Vista World as you progress through beautifully designed levels, each with its own unique challenges and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/ca270ea1c4fd537b1bd4f6ae7028fa73.avif?t=1754283788\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/3771a4eaeb25c12fd37a802a2bf4f250.webp?t=1754283788\" /></div>Unlock and master a vast array of abilities that enhance your gameplay. From gravity manipulating canned vegetables to hang gliding soap bubbles, each ability adds a new layer of depth and excitement to your platforming adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/4c3552a75ad449cd8a537317da3c18ae.avif?t=1754283788\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/3d31403efafccf3adb72312a8a451be2.avif?t=1754283788\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/47c05f556f88522c7acf0052517ed0c4.webp?t=1754283788\" /></div>Dive into a world where every jump, slide, and dash feels incredibly satisfying. Vista World offers an immersive platforming experience that keeps you on the edge of your seat with its captivating gameplay and stunning visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/6c9aba017536fc7f77549ceee3b08c65.poster.avif?t=1754283788\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/6c9aba017536fc7f77549ceee3b08c65.webm?t=1754283788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/6c9aba017536fc7f77549ceee3b08c65.mp4?t=1754283788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/bebb79ba4b7f7f7ea091ba93721e1caf.webp?t=1754283788\" /></div>Unleash your creativity with our intuitive level editor. Build intricate levels from scratch, place traps, enemies, and obstacles, and share your creations with the community. The only limit is your imagination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/14733493bbdee2b02f6ac291def2dc29.poster.avif?t=1754283788\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/14733493bbdee2b02f6ac291def2dc29.webm?t=1754283788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/14733493bbdee2b02f6ac291def2dc29.mp4?t=1754283788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/c3c62a0178cfd8afb618a88fcae05793.webp?t=1754283788\" /></div>Join a vibrant community of creators and players. Design your own levels, share them with friends, and explore an ever-growing library of user-generated content. The adventure never ends in Vista World.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/39b83086a413392d7916f769aaafccb2.avif?t=1754283788\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/65ef6e01133b752067248d7df70a29bd.webp?t=1754283788\" /></div>Experience the smoothest and most responsive controls in a platformer. Every movement is designed to be fluid and precise, giving you complete control over your character as you navigate through challenging environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/7dfbec5c4d91e0f334fe3ff9a2011174.poster.avif?t=1754283788\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/7dfbec5c4d91e0f334fe3ff9a2011174.webm?t=1754283788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/7dfbec5c4d91e0f334fe3ff9a2011174.mp4?t=1754283788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/3d23f1f5075392c62f28b9890c798348.webp?t=1754283788\" /></div>Face off against a variety of dynamic enemies and navigate through perilous traps. Each encounter is designed to test your skills and keep you engaged, ensuring that no two levels feel the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/ea796aaabbcaa4126d9841713f5051ae.avif?t=1754283788\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/c1951cbccc126b43a0f4748f31de1546.webp?t=1754283788\" /></div>Embark on an epic journey through a meticulously crafted story mode. Discover the secrets of Vista World as you progress through beautifully designed levels, each with its own unique challenges and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/ca270ea1c4fd537b1bd4f6ae7028fa73.avif?t=1754283788\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/3771a4eaeb25c12fd37a802a2bf4f250.webp?t=1754283788\" /></div>Unlock and master a vast array of abilities that enhance your gameplay. From gravity manipulating canned vegetables to hang gliding soap bubbles, each ability adds a new layer of depth and excitement to your platforming adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/4c3552a75ad449cd8a537317da3c18ae.avif?t=1754283788\" /></div></p>",
    "short_description": "Vista World is an engaging 3D platformer with a sandbox-style level editor. Create, share, and explore endless levels. Enjoy the incredibly smooth movement, dynamic enemies, engaging traps, a hand-crafted story mode, and a vast array of abilities that augment gameplay. What are you waiting for?",
